---
description: Decide field-level findings for trackArcs.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Identify unresolved setups, character goals, relationship changes, and narrative promises across installments. Distinguish intentional mystery from accidental omission, and preserve motivations that constrain plausible future actions without treating characters as mechanically fixed. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
